WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
- My next guest was a standout
on "Dancing with the Stars"

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.920
last year and we all know and love her

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:08.160
from nine seasons on "The
Office", let's get Kate Flannery

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.167
on the line right now.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:10.989
Hi, hi, hi.

00:00:10.989 --> 00:00:12.570
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.960
Hey Kate.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.180
- What's up girl?

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:19.500
Yeah!
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.780
You look great.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.390
We both look a little
different than the last time

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.600
we saw each other.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.820
- Just a little bit, yeah.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.580
It just happens during these times.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.660
I thought we were still
doin' the Halloween thing,

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.580
last time I saw you I had a wig on, so.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.560
- You know what, challenge accepted,

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.670
I think on our show, we
should do costumes more often.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.219
But no, you didn't have to wear a costume.

00:00:38.219 --> 00:00:40.160
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.844
- So, I didn't want you to think,

00:00:42.844 --> 00:00:45.833
I haven't been to the
beauty parlor either.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.003
- The mustache is full on.

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.900
Well earlier this year you were

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.090
on "Dancing With the Stars" tour, right?

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.260
That's a huge tour.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.910
- I got to do 45 of our 55 shows,

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.190
but then of course we
got taken off the road.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:03.280
But you know, I'm really proud of myself,

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.260
I'm 55-years-old, I'm like a 15-year-old

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:07.490
trapped in a 55-year-old body Kelly.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:08.390
- Aren't we all.

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:10.120
- It was so exciting though.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:14.120
Huge audiences, so many great fans,

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.720
it was really insane,
it was really wonderful.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:18.700
- Yeah, I mean, and what's cool though,

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.350
y'all got to do most of the tour.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:22.610
A lot of people didn't get to do anything.

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:25.170
That's really cool, and for people to get

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.610
to come see y'all live,
and it's so entertaining

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:29.670
what you do, and it's
such an athletic thing

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:31.727
that all of us close
our eyes and we're like,

00:01:31.727 --> 00:01:33.730
"Yeah, I'm totally Jennifer
Gray in Dirty Dancing,"

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:36.483
but then in real life,
we're like not happening.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.920
Okay wait, I have to show you something,

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.750
'cause, okay, you sent me this doll,

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.370
and everybody, there's been a
lot of people doing tributes

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.790
stuff to you, 'cause we looked into it.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.690
There are a lot of people
that do tributes to you,

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:49.090
and that's such a compliment,

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:50.920
but this doll is amazing!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:53.060
- It's the Meredith casual Friday doll.

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:55.736
That's the Funko Pop! Doll.

00:01:55.736 --> 00:01:57.890
It's insane, I know, I know.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:59.730
We could have a little conversation,

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:00.563
I've got mine.

00:02:00.563 --> 00:02:01.410
- [Kelly] Far out!

00:02:02.487 --> 00:02:03.440
- It's insane.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.580
You know what, they just started working

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.570
on "The Office" this past year,

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.475
and I was literally at
my boyfriend's son's

00:02:10.475 --> 00:02:12.370
high school graduation in Everett,

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.200
and we stopped at the Funko store

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.287
in Everett, Washington,
and they were like,

00:02:16.287 --> 00:02:18.630
"Hey, come with me,"
and then they showed me

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:20.040
the Michael Scott Funko Pop!

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.320
And they're like, "We're starting!"

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:25.197
And so one year later, Casual
Friday Meredith appears.

00:02:25.197 --> 00:02:26.330
(Kate laughs)

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.030
- That's so cool!

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:30.270
This, I don't know if
you've seen this yet,

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:33.513
but this is a chalk painting of Meredith.

00:02:33.513 --> 00:02:34.880
Oh my gosh!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.890
- [Kate] All chalk, it's
from the lice episode

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:39.120
of "The Office" from
season nine when Meredith

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.382
shaved her head.

00:02:40.382 --> 00:02:41.215
(Kate laughs)

00:02:41.215 --> 00:02:42.497
I look like Benjamin
Franklin, but that's okay.

00:02:42.497 --> 00:02:43.943
- That's okay!

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:47.370
That is so funny.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:51.726
But to impact someone enough to do that,

00:02:51.726 --> 00:02:55.600
I don't even know how these
people do this chalk art,

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:56.670
it is insane to me.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.091
- [Kate] There's so much
love for "The Office" too.

00:02:59.091 --> 00:03:00.950
- This one's really, coming from a quilter

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.810
that's totally not even average,

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:07.610
I'm like basic Betty
good, this is amazing.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:10.530
You're immortalized in needlepoint,

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:12.320
which is not easy.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.410
That's so cool.

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:16.700
- [Kate] Yes, Jamie, she was a
"Dancing With the Stars" fan,

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.870
that's me and my dancing
partner, Pasha Pashkov.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:19.703
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:19.703 --> 00:03:20.600
- She gave it to me on the tour,

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.910
I actually have a copy of it too.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.579
She made a few of them,
she made one for him

00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:24.412
and one for me.

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:26.040
- That's so cool!

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:31.040
I mean, I received many
gifts, just from fans

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.520
over the years, and that's really cool,

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.600
that takes time, that's not just--

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:40.450
- Yeah, I've met her, I think
we met in North Carolina,

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.310
one of the shows.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.200
And then someone made me
this crazy Meredith doll,

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.220
which I think is really
more like a Barbie doll

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.850
because my face has never
been this beautiful.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.496
Maybe with some plastic surgery.

00:03:49.496 --> 00:03:52.166
(both laugh)

00:03:52.166 --> 00:03:54.850
- No, that's amazing!

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.160
I love it.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.837
It's so funny how people they're like,

00:03:58.837 --> 00:04:01.290
"Oh I love this person," how
in their own line of work

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.940
they get to kind of lift you up

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:06.760
and praise someone that they love

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.780
that has impacted them,
or made them laugh,

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.730
or they've been able to be their escapism.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.820
It's cool how that comes
out in many different forms.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.980
- I'm really, I'm so grateful.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.563
- I love that, and I
love that you see that.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:22.670
I don't know, I know we've both met people

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:25.350
or know people that forget
how blessed they are,

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.910
and you know, aren't
counting the blessings

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.610
and counting the mistakes
or things they didn't get.

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.850
And it's like, it's really
cool that you recognize that,

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.000
'cause we're all lucky.

00:04:36.431 --> 00:04:38.390
We're all replaceable,
you know what I'm saying?

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:40.440
Somebody could be doing what we're doing.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.830
It's really cool that you recognize that

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.350
and you're having fun,
that's the coolest thing

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:47.010
about talking to you Kate,
every time I talk to you,

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.830
you genuinely have, and
your boyfriend told me this

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.820
a while back when he
was, he's a photographer

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.077
for "The Voice" and he was like,

00:04:54.077 --> 00:04:55.690
"You and my girlfriend
have a lot in common,"

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.090
'cause we are both really energetic,

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.620
and I try to be positive,
and I try to always focus

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.140
on what I have.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:03.700
- You're so positive, you're so great,

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.710
you're so encouraging!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.700
- That's what I love about you as well.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.150
It's not easy, and I think people think

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:09.620
you just come out that way, and you don't,

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.350
it's something you have to work at

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:15.507
and really keep perspective,
and you're so cool.

00:05:15.507 --> 00:05:17.100
- Oh thank you Kelly, oh my god,

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.190
right back at ya.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.720
But I really think getting older,

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.674
it's like you either get
smarter or you get dumber.

00:05:21.674 --> 00:05:22.507
(Kate laughs)

00:05:22.507 --> 00:05:23.340
- And it gets easier I think.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:27.230
I don't know, I've always
kind of been this person,

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:29.793
but for some reason, it's gotten easier

00:05:29.793 --> 00:05:31.360
the older I get.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.190
It's not that you don't
care, it's that you care

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:35.000
about what's important, I think.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.190
- Right, right.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:39.510
Well you know, I mean, these
times are so challenging

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:40.343
for so many reasons.

00:05:40.343 --> 00:05:45.230
I feel like it's time
to focus on the change

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.320
that's happening in the world,

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.600
and accept that there's so many things

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:51.910
that are not right.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:55.670
I made a decision to donate
part of my Cameo proceeds

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:59.980
to the NAACP, and just
so I can sleep at night

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:04.930
and feel like whatever more
I can do, I'm learning.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:05.763
I'm learning every day.

00:06:05.763 --> 00:06:06.596
- No, that's what I do too.

00:06:06.596 --> 00:06:08.350
That was my big thing, I was like, okay,

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:11.740
instead of I do what I can where I can,

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:14.600
but I think a lot of it is,
and a lot of the problem is,

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.620
is that don't try and understand,

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.710
you're never gonna
understand where someone's

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.540
coming from if it's such a
different perspective from me,

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:26.080
such a different life,
such a different view,

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.880
just listen, and listen
to them on how maybe

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:29.713
things can improve.

00:06:29.713 --> 00:06:32.532
And I think if we all just
did that a little more,

00:06:32.532 --> 00:06:36.083
it would work, and we'd
finally see the change

00:06:36.083 --> 00:06:38.810
that so many people have
fought and died for.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.500
- Kelly you are awesome.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.950
- You are too, I love talkin',

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:43.650
thank you for doin' my show again.

